        "original_id": "5a37b61f-b39d-5700-bfc3-e040493e749f",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Pierre-Joseph Proudhon, Édouard Jonas, Édouard Berth, Olivier Ferrand\n- Organizations: National Assembly of France, Cercle Proudhon\n- Works: What Is Property?\n\nFacts:\n- Pierre-Joseph Proudhon was the author of What Is Property?.\n- Pierre-Joseph Proudhon was a member of the National Assembly of France.\n- Édouard Jonas and Édouard Berth founded the Cercle Proudhon.\n- Pierre-Joseph Proudhon inspired the Cercle Proudhon.\n- Olivier Ferrand was elected to the National Assembly of France.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
